---
description: Wait for CI and PR reviews; fix until they pass
alwaysApply: true
---

After every code push on a PR:

1. Wait for GitHub CI/checks to finish.
2. Read any PR review comments (human, Bugbot, Copilot, and similar).
3. Fix failures and address review feedback; push again and repeat.
4. Do not consider the task complete until checks are green and outstanding review issues are resolved (or explicitly deferred by Nic).

PR reviews run automatically on GitHub. The task is not complete until those reviews pass. If they do not pass, read the errors on GitHub and fix until they do.
